        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Electronic Transfers",
            "block_bbox": [
                500,
                381,
                722,
                407
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    500.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    722.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    722.0,
                    407.0
                ],
                [
                    500.0,
                    407.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Commonwealth of Massachusetts, through the Human Resources Division (HRD), and the Massachusetts Organization of State Engineers and Scientists, (MOSES), are parties to a Collective Bargaining Agreement which provides for employees covered by the terms and conditions of the Agreement to have their salaries transferred electronically by means of direct deposit. Whereas MOSES has expressed concern that not all employees would be able to avail themselves of the electronic transfer because of severe hardship, the parties agree as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                434,
                1069,
                592
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    434.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    434.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    592.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Commonwealth and MOSES agree that all employees will have their net salary checks electronically forwarded to an account or accounts selected by the employee;",
            "block_bbox": [
                139,
                615,
                1075,
                669
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    139.0,
                    615.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    615.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    669.0
                ],
                [
                    139.0,
                    669.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In the extraordinary event that MOSES alleges that an employee cannot comply with the Collective Bargaining Agreement relative to the electronic transfer due to severe hardship such as inability to access a bank or financial institution during off hours or, there is not an ATM available within a reasonable geographic distance from an employee's worksite or home, or in the case of domestic violence where a person purposely does not want to have an account for safety reasons, MOSES shall petition the Human Resources Division for a Direct Deposit Special Exemption;",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                693,
                1075,
                877
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    693.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    693.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    877.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    877.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Human Resources Division, in concert with the Office of the State Comptroller, shall review the request for the Direct Deposit Special Exemption filed by MOSES and will notify MOSES of its finding;",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                900,
                1074,
                980
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    137.0,
                    900.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    900.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    980.0
                ],
                [
                    137.0,
                    980.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The Parties agree that no other appeal may be commenced by the employee or MOSES relative to the Direct Deposit Special Exemption and further, that this Memorandum is not grievable and is inarbitrable.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                1005,
                1075,
                1085
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    1005.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    1005.0
                ],
                [
                    1075.0,
                    1085.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    1085.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Provisions of this Memorandum of Understanding shall be coterminous with the duration of this collective bargaining agreement as provided in Article 29.",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                1109,
                1042,
                1162
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
